msgid "This message contains a similar link that is contained within <span> and </span>. Make sure you correctly keep all the tags (<...>), and that the link is completely contained within the <span> and </span> tags in your translation. Make sure that the text inside the \"a\" tags correspond to \"help page\" and that your translation corresponding to the second sentence is contained in the <span> tags. Note how the full stop is still inside the </span> tag."
